 "brief_title": "AVANDAMET Versus Metformin And Sulphonylurea In People With Poorly Controlled Type 2 Diabetes",
 "official_title": "A Randomised, Multi-Centre, Phase IV, Double-Blind, Parallel Group Study Comparing the Effects of 52 Weeks Administration of AVANDAMET and Metformin Plus Sulphonylurea on Change in HbA1c From Baseline in Overweight Type 2 Diabetics Poorly Controlled on Metformin.",
